I would point out the home gym.

You know the camera kit is in the home gym, and Bob wants it. If you tell him the library, he’ll search the library, find the faded sticky note, realize you misled him, and then check the home gym anyway — giving others time to beat him to it. 

Pointing him to the home gym gets him to the correct room immediately, so he can steal it before anyone else does. The sticky note is a decoy;
